ontent also includes books, case studies, Datamonitor company and industry profiles, conference proceedings, country reports (from CountryWatch, EIU, Icon International, and others), market research reports, SWOT analyses, profiles of the most-cited authors, and more. Sole electronic resource for full text of the <i>Harvard Business Review</i> and <i>California Management Review</i>.</p></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"http://www.researchsource.amdigital.co.uk/BusEconLab\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '53908351',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                Business, Economic and Labour History\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\">Historical sources from Britain and America, covering key subjects such as Keynesian economic policy in post-war Britain; international labour movements; the London Stock Exchange; and the papers of important economists. Includes a complete run of the <i>Stock Exchange Official Year-book</i> for 1875-1945 and working papers of John Maynard Keynes and his private office during his second period of service at the Treasury.</div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"https://cas.ceicdata.com/login\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '5617540',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                CEICdata: Global Database\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\"><p>Global economic data, including normalized GDP, CPI, imports, exports, retail sales, and interest rates. Optional registration allows personalization, but \"guest access\" (plus <a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/use/computers-computing-services/connect-campus\" target=\"_blank\">VPN authentication</a>) provides access to UCLA's subscription, which consists of these two modules: the <strong>Global Database</strong> and the <strong>High Frequency Database</strong>.</p></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"http://search.proquest.com/econlit/advanced?accountid=14512\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '5617703',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                EconLit\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\">The fundamental research tool in economics with bibliographic citations, and some abstracts, to the international literature on economics since 1969. Subjects covered include book reviews, business, economics, finance, industry and statistics.</div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"https://guides.library.ucla.edu/free-resources/home\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Open Access\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/33899/32px-Lock-orange-alt-4.svg.png\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"http://data.imf.org/\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '5617904',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                IMF eLibrary Data\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\">Analysis of finance, development, macroeconomics, poverty reduction, trade, and globalization from the International Monetary Fund. Includes Balance of Payments (BOP), Direction of Trade Statistics (DOTS), Government Finance Statistics (GFS), International Finance Statistics (IFS), and more.</div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"https://www.marketresearch.amdigital.co.uk/\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '5617367',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                Market Research &amp; American Business, 1935-1965\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\"><p>Provides insight into the American consumer boom of the mid-20th century through access to the complete market research reports of Ernest Dichter, the era's foremost consumer analyst and market research pioneer.</p></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"https://academic.oup.com/edited-volume/61801?login=true\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '68917638',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                Oxford Research Encyclopedia of Economics and Finance\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\"><p>One of a series of <strong>Oxford Research Encyclopedias</strong>, presenting peer-reviewed articles on a wide range of topics, such as Anthropology, Business and Management, Climate Science, Communication, Criminology, Economics, Education, Global Public Health, History, Linguistics, Literature, Planetary Science, Politics, Psychology and Religion.</p></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                    <span class=\"s-lg-az-result-badge-featured label\">Best Bet</span>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"https://academic.oup.com/oxford-research-encyclopedias?login=true\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '68918617',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                Oxford Research Encyclopedias\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\"><p><strong>Oxford Research Encyclopedias</strong> is a series of digital works that present peer-reviewed articles on a wide range of topics, such as Anthropology, Business and Management, Climate Science, Communication, Criminology, Economics, Education, Global Public Health, History, Linguistics, Literature, Planetary Science, Politics, Psychology and Religion.</p></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div><div id=\"s-lg-sb-name-regular\" class=\"s-lg-db-panel\"><div class=\"s-lg-db-panel-title\" style=\"border-bottom:none;\">Additional Databases</div><div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"http://www.americanhistory.amdigital.co.uk/\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '5617376',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                American History, 1493-1945\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\">The Gilder Lehrman Institute of American History’s archive of letters, diaries, maps pamphlets, printed books, newspapers, and ephemera sheds light on the political, economic, and social history of the United States up until the 20th century. The majority of the collection is unique manuscripts, with special emphasis on the revolutionary, early national, antebellum, and civil war eras.</div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <div class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-border-round s-lib-box-idx-guide-list\">\n        <div class=\"s-lib-box-content\">\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-badges s-lg-gmeta pull-right s-lg-small s-lib-color-lt-grey\">\n                <div class=\"s-lg-icons pad-left-sm\"><ul class=\"\"><li><a href=\"http://www.library.ucla.edu/service/campus-access\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Requires UCLA authentication\" class=\"s-lg-icon\" src=\"//d2jv02qf7xgjwx.cloudfront.net/sites/705/icons/983/key-newblue-transp.gif\"/><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-external-link \" \n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n           title=\"This link opens in a new window\"\n   ></i><span class=\"sr-only\">This link opens in a new window</span></a> </li></ul></div>\n                                                                            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-gtitle\" >\n                                <a  target=&quot;_blank&quot;  href=\"https://www.foreignofficefilessoutheastasia.amdigital.co.uk\" onclick=\"return springSpace.springTrack.trackLink({link: this,_st_type_id: '16',_st_content_id: '52203524',_st_inc_return: this});\">\n                                                                Foreign Office Files for Southeast Asia, 1963-1980\n                                                        </a>\n                                \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"s-lg-az-result-description\"><p>Module 1. Published in two parts, this collection of Foreign Office Files explores South East Asia between 1963 and 1980: the Cold War in the Pacific, trade relations and the Post-Independence Period, 1963-1966. And, the Foundations of economic growth and industrialisation, 1967-1980.</p></div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","experts":"<div class=\"margin-bottom-xlg\"><div class=\"s-lib-public-side-header\"><h2 class=\"pad-bottom-sm\">Economics Experts</h2></div><div class=\"txt pad-top-sm\"><div id=\"s-lg-box-profile-container\" class=\"s-lib-box-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"s-lg-box-profile\" class=\"s-lib-box s-lib-box-std\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"s-lib-box-title\">Librarian</h2><div id=\"s-lg-box-